  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "title",
      "value": "Hemmorhage"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "json": [
        {
          "text": "A sinister spell marking the crescendo of a "
        },
        {
          "text": "Curse of Agony",
          "color": "blue"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon its victim.  The "
        },
        {
          "text": "curse is consumed",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", amplifying their suffering until it reaches a breaking point and ruptures in a violent eruption of internal chaos. This explosive release not only delivers "
        },
        {
          "text": "devastating damage",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the target but, should they succumb to the spell's tremendous force, unleashes a torrential spray of crimson that arcs outward, showering "
        },
        {
          "text": "all nearby",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " in a ghastly deluge of blood with such force that they will "
        },
        {
          "text": "take a portion of the damage as well",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ".\n\nThis can only be the work of the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Demons of the Nether.",
          "color": "dark_red"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "related_recipes": [
